## 快速上手

```bash
# 克隆到云电脑
git clone https://github.com/lawrence-1998-jpg/binance_B9_rcmd_strategy_service- ~/crypto-news-crawler

# 安装依赖
pip install -r requirements.txt

# 初始化数据库
mysql -uroot -p < config/schema.sql

# 手动跑一轮
python3 run_pipeline.py

# 验证零丢失
mysql -uroot -p'***REMOVED***' crypto_news -e \
  "SELECT run_at, raw_count, enriched_count, events_count, status FROM pipeline_runs ORDER BY run_at DESC LIMIT 3;"
```

---

